(text "I2C1-6 share one bus (D4/D5, 400 kHz, 2.2k pull-up). I2C5/6: 5 V power, 3.3 V logic.\nPULSE-A/B and AUX: 1 12V 2 5V 3 GND 4 IO (same as PULSE-IN adapter). D10 is shared by AUX, GPS PPS (JP9) and the PC power button (JP2): use one." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214.63 544.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9246a168-e41d-4fe1-82f5-f7fe8896c6f2"))
